[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0738","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0738.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0942","title":"UnixWare dos7utils STATICMERGE 环境变量本地权限提升漏洞","description":"UnixWare 操作系统的 dos7utils 工具集存在本地权限提升漏洞。该漏洞源于 dos7utils 在处理 STATICMERGE 环境变量时，会按照该变量指定的路径搜索并执行脚本文件，且未对执行权限进行有效限制。拥有本地低权限账户的攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过设置 STATICMERGE 环境变量指向恶意脚本，在 dos7utils 执行时触发该脚本，从而获取系统 root 最高权限。该漏洞影响 UnixWare 操作系统中包含 dos7utils 的版本，CVSS v2.0 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高危。攻击者需具备对目标系统的本地访问权限才能成功利用此漏洞完成权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0942"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-10-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 UnixWare 系统至厂商提供的最新补丁版本，或移除 dos7utils 工具集上不必要的 setuid 权限。如系统已停止维护，建议限制本地用户对 dos7utils 二进制文件的执行权限（如 chmod 750），仅允许受信任的管理员用户使用，并考虑迁移至受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0942","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0942"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0738.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1140","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1140.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1500","title":"True North Internet Anywhere Mail Server POP3 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"True North Internet Anywhere Mail Server 2.3.1 的 POP3 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 POP3 端口发送特制的 LIST、TOP 或 UIDL 命令（以字母作为参数）触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃，影响邮件服务的正常可用性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1500"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:34Z","remediation":"由于 True North Internet Anywhere Mail Server 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即升级至仍在安全支持周期内的邮件服务器（如 Dovecot、Exchange Server 等）。若无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面限制仅允许信任 IP 访问 TCP 端口 110（POP3），并配置入侵检测规则拦截包含异常参数的 LIST/TOP/UIDL 请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93880357530599&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/733","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/453c5421de2e86e7c24435e1e7daaae43fb314cf/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1500.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1500","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1500.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1500.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6bc63e285c0a79cc94c82503bf7e4166838dea6f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j8pg-jpr2-jc5g/GHSA-j8pg-jpr2-jc5g.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1500.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/733/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eabc95cdb5ea0fc6b08883f500cfec2a05eaea46/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1140.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1109","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0879","title":"Washington University WU-FTPD 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Washington University WU-FTPD 2.5.0 在处理 message 文件中的宏变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的包含恶意宏变量的 message 文件，触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 WU-FTPD 2.5.0 及相关的 FTP 服务器软件，CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，攻击复杂度低，危害等级严重。攻击者只需建立 FTP 连接并上传或触发包含超长宏变量的 message 文件即可完成利用，已有公开的远程利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0879"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:14Z","remediation":"WU-FTPD 已停止维护多年，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即停止使用 WU-FTPD，迁移至受支持的替代 FTP 服务器软件，如 vsftpd 3.0.x、ProFTPD 1.3.x 或 Pure-FTPD 最新稳定版。如无法立即迁移，可在 ftpaccess 配置文件中禁用所有 message 文件处理功能，并在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务访问来源 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0879","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19560","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a5db9ce197a4914a8237308d958cd159d8832fe6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0879.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0879","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0879.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0879.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w87h-rw9r-9p4c/GHSA-w87h-rw9r-9p4c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0879.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000801.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/wu_ftpd_overflow.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1019","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1236","title":"Internet Anywhere Mail Server 明文密码存储权限提升漏洞","description":"Internet Anywhere Mail Server 2.3.1 存在密码明文存储漏洞，该软件将用户密码以明文形式保存在 msgboxes.dbf 文件中，本地攻击者可读取该文件并直接获取明文密码，进而提升权限。此漏洞源于对敏感数据缺乏加密保护，属于本地利用，攻击者需拥有系统本地访问权限。影响 Internet Anywhere Mail Server 2.3.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1236"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:00Z","remediation":"Internet Anywhere Mail Server 2.3.1 已将停止维护，无法通过官方补丁修复。建议立即迁移至受支持的邮件服务器（如 Postfix、Exim 或 Exchange Online），同时将 msgboxes.dbf 文件权限收紧为仅管理员可读（chmod 600），并排查已被本地低权限用户窃取的明文口令，及时修改关联账户密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9910&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=662","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/731","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3285","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1236.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1236","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1236.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1236.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7p62-2h53-pmjh/GHSA-7p62-2h53-pmjh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1236.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/731/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000802.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d9