T/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/112b6cf2eb30218e492a77c7d1bcb2220cd940b5/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0732.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0671","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0671.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0880","title":"University of Washington wu-ftpd SITE NEWER 内存耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"University of Washington 开发的 wu-ftpd FTP 服务器软件存在内存泄漏漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的 SITE NEWER 命令，导致服务器无法正确释放已分配的内存，进而造成内存资源耗尽，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 wu-ftpd 多个版本，远程未认证攻击者可利用此漏洞使服务崩溃，无需任何权限即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0880"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:14Z","remediation":"升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.6.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了 SITE NEWER 命令的内存泄漏问题。如无法升级，建议迁移至 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD 等仍在维护的 FTP 服务器软件，并在迁移前限制匿名用户的 SITE 命令执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0880","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a5db9ce197a4914a8237308d958cd159d8832fe6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0880.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0880","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0880.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0880.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1864.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/ftp.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0880.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cb579db7-be74-40d7-b4ad-7156c6b93267.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0671.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0670","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0670.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0877","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer IFRAME 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0 及 4.0.1 版本中存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，利用 IFRAME 元素调用 ExecCommand 方法，绕过同源策略限制，读取目标用户本地文件系统中的任意文件。攻击者只需诱使用户访问恶意网站即可触发，无需任何身份认证。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上使用 IE 浏览器的用户，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0877"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:14Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 6.0 或更高版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，建议禁用 Active Scripting 功能，或将受影响的站点添加到受限站点区域以阻止 IFRAME 脚本执行。长期建议迁移至现代浏览器（如 Edge/Chrome/Firefox）以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ243638","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-042","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19539","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a5db9ce197a4914a8237308d958cd159d8832fe6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0877.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0877","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0877.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0877.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w826-4h49-9hfv/GHSA-w826-4h49-9hfv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0877.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0670.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0670.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0670.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0534","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0794","title":"Microsoft Excel SYLK格式文件宏处理不当漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 在处理符号链接（SYLK）格式文件时存在安全缺陷，当 SYLK 文件内嵌宏代码时，Excel 未向用户发出安全警告，导致宏代码可在用户不知情的情况下自动执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Excel 97 及早期版本，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开精心制作的包含恶意宏的 SYLK 文件，在用户不知情的情况下执行任意宏代码，可能导致任意代码执行、数据窃取或系统破坏。攻击条件为受害者需打开攻击者构造的恶意 SYLK 文件，利用方式为通过电子邮件附件、网页下载或文件共享传播恶意 SYLK 文件诱导用户打开。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0794"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-10-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-044 对应的补丁（知识库文章 Q241900/Q241901/Q241902）。如无法立即更新，可在 Excel 选项中将宏安全级别设为“高”或“非常高”，禁止未经提示的宏自动执行，并避免打开来历不明的 SYLK 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ241900","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ241901","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ241902","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-044"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1199","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1583","title":"IBM AIX nslookup 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AIX 4.3 的 nslookup 工具中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向命令行参数传递超长 hostname 字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 AIX 4.3 操作系统，本地攻击者需具有系统登录权限，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议受影响的系统及时升级至安全版本或安装 IBM 发布的补丁程序。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1583"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM AIX 4.3 的 APAR IY02120 补丁修复 nslookup 缓冲区溢出漏洞；如无法打补丁，可删除 nslookup 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/nslookup）缓解本地提权风险，或限制不可信用户的本地登录权限。建议升级至 AIX 5.1 及以上版本以彻底规避此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY02120&apar=only","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/872443","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8031","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1583.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1583","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1583.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1583.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4h92-xfmc-824q/GHSA-4h92-xfmc-824q.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83038/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1583.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000799.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dcde3665-1f4c-45ba-be37-257403a906b4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1120","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1469","title":"Hughes Technologies miniSQL w3-auth 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"miniSQL 数据库管理软件中的 w3-auth CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 URL 或 User-Agent MIME 头部中传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 miniSQL 软件的系统，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1469"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:30Z","remediation":"移除或禁用 miniSQL 软件包中的 w3-auth CGI 程序。如仍需使用，限制仅可通过 localhost 访问该 CGI，并在 Web 服务器（Apache 等）配置中对 w3-auth 路径添加 IP 白名单和认证机制，防止未授权远程访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93871926821410&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d0edc539747872cdfd58847b81673ec0de903cd8/c