-06-16T21:49:21Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止维护的 MediaHouse Software Statistics Server 4.28/5.1，厂商已无安全更新。建议立即停用该产品并迁移至受支持的替代统计服务软件。如无法立即迁移，应在网络边界防火墙配置规则，限制仅可信 IP 访问 Statistics Server 端口，并在应用层部署入侵检测系统（IDS）拦截包含超长 Server ID 字段的恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/734","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19562","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8de487bef2c8b1936da1237463dc6052a1fcd655/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0931.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0931","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0931.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/263f37bc67cd24fe03a39077d8b57f3001369a95/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0931.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-956v-wm2r-68mw/GHSA-956v-wm2r-68mw.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/mediahouse_statistics_web_server.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0931.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b7356c2e-1829-404f-92e3-4ad5d2d0069d.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0730.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0730.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-09310","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-09310.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0931","title":"MediaHouse Software Statistics Server 'Server ID' 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MediaHouse Software Statistics Server 4.28 和 5.1 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 Server ID 字段发送特制数据触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致拒绝服务或远程执行任意命令。攻击无需身份认证，仅需网络访问即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0931"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb","avd"],"published":"1999-09-30T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，建议立即停用 MediaHouse Statistics Server，迁移至受支持的替代统计服务软件。如无法立即替换，应在防火墙层面限制对该服务端口的网络访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/734","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0931"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-09310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0731","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0731.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0932","title":"Mediahouse Statistics Server 管理员密码明文存储漏洞","description":"Mediahouse Statistics Server 的 ss.cfg 配置文件中以明文存储管理员密码（admin password），未进行任何加密或哈希处理。远程攻击者可通过 Web 路径遍历或直接请求 ss.cfg 文件路径（如 /ss.cfg）读取该文件，获取管理员密码后可直接登录管理后台，完全控制统计服务器。该漏洞源于开发者在配置文件中硬编码凭据且未设置访问权限控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0932"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-30T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"1) 立即将 ss.cfg 文件权限设置为仅管理员可读写（chmod 600），禁止 Web 用户访问；2) 在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中添加规则拒绝直接访问 ss.cfg 文件；3) 将密码迁移至数据库或使用 bcrypt/argon2 哈希存储；4) 升级至 Mediahouse Statistics Server 最新版本或迁移至其他支持安全凭据管理的统计软件；5) 在防火墙层面限制管理后台仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/735"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0731.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0731.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1067","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1350","title":"ARCAD Systemhaus 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"ARCAD Systemhaus 0.078-5 在安装时将关键程序及文件设置为全局可写权限，本地攻击者可利用此缺陷用特洛伊木马替换正常程序，从而在目标系统上实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 ARCAD Systemhaus 0.078-5 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1350"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:15Z","remediation":"升级 ARCAD Systemhaus 至最新版本以修复文件权限问题；如无法升级，手动执行 `chmod 755` 或 `chmod 750` 收紧关键程序与文件权限，确保仅属主和授权用户可写；并部署文件完整性监控（如 Tripwire）检测异常文件变更。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93871933521519&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1350.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1350","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1350.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1350.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jcrv-cvh4-phpv/GHSA-jcrv-cvh4-phpv.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1350.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000796.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f41da9b9307a4d911b4942758c5aa9f31086a333/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1069","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1352","title":"Linux kernel mknod 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 2.2 内核中的 mknod 系统调用存在符号链接跟随漏洞，本地攻击者可通过创建特制符号链接诱导特权进程调用 mknod，从而覆盖任意系统文件或提升权限。该漏洞影响 Linux 2.2 系列内核，攻击者需具备本地用户权限，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1352"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:15Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.14 及以上版本（推荐使用 2.4 或更高长期支持内核），此漏洞在后续版本中已被修复，mknod 系统调用在执行前会先检查目标是否为符号链接。若无法升级内核，可通过 LSM（Linux Security Module，如 SELinux）限制 mknod 系统调用的使用范围，仅允许特权进程执行设备节点创建操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93855134409747&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1352.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1352.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1352","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1352.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1352.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/911f5a223608d942c4f7bd1db06939fd49c06258/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-13xx/CVE-1999-1352.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3e445d6e72df66df19d5ed1646de49292abb177/1999/CVE-1999-1352.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27bda0043c24e3a60635efaebd455bc46f911f61/api/1999/CVE-1999-1352.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094